(1738386, 236203, 37544, '<td valign="top">very nice picture!</td>', 'very nice picture!', '2005-09-26 01:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1738394, 235864, 37544, '<td valign="top">wonderful!!</td>', 'wonderful!!', '2005-09-26 01:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1738411, 236244, 14736, '<td valign="top">For me, the high contrast makes it difficult to distinguish the objects in the photo (I can''t see the sand dollar).  My usual dsclaimer is that this is my opinion and many people enjoy very high contrast photos.  The composition is good though.</td>', 'For me, the high contrast makes it difficult to distinguish the objects in the photo (I can''t see the sand dollar).  My usual dsclaimer is that this is my opinion and many people enjoy very high contrast photos.  The composition is good though.', '2005-09-26 01:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1738414, 236222, 41522, '<td valign="top">I feel this captures the challenge well.  Nice colours on the monarch.  Focus is okay but I would have liked the background just a little more blurred and uniform.</td>', 'I feel this captures the challenge well.  Nice colours on the monarch.  Focus is okay but I would have liked the background just a little more blurred and uniform.', '2005-09-26 01:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1738416, 236211, 18197, '<td valign="top">I am sorry this is so small. I would have loved to see it bigger.</td>', 'I am sorry this is so small. I would have loved to see it bigger.', '2005-09-26 01:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1738419, 236213, 43256, '<td valign="top">You''re really obsessed with your little doll, aren''t you? :-P</td>', 'You''re really obsessed with your little doll, aren''t you? :-P', '2005-09-26 01:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1738425, 235887, 41522, '<td valign="top">I think this is a good fit into the challenge.  Nice composition, good colours ... my only complaint would be that I find the soft focus on the rightmost tulip to be soft and as such a bit of a distraction.</td>', 'I think this is a good fit into the challenge.  Nice composition, good colours ... my only complaint would be that I find the soft focus on the rightmost tulip to be soft and as such a bit of a distraction.', '2005-09-26 01:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1738428, 234752, 14736, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photograph, I love the colors.  I love how smooth and calm the water is in front of the duck next to the roughened water.  The bill doesn''t seem to be as sharp as the rest of the duck and maybe a little more contrast would pick it up slightly (I would either want to see more detail or less detail in the reflection rather than the gray look).</td>', 'Beautiful photograph, I love the colors.  I love how smooth and calm the water is in front of the duck next to the roughened water.  The bill doesn''t seem to be as sharp as the rest of the duck and maybe a little more contrast would pick it up slightly (I would either want to see more detail or less detail in the reflection rather than the gray look).', '2005-09-26 01:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1738431, 236132, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 1/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 1/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 2/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 1/2Contrast/Color: 1/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 2/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2', '2005-09-26 01:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1738436, 236353, 14736, '<td valign="top">This is an inspirational view.  Black and white looks nice.  The snow on the mountain could be a little whiter and maybe you could crop or reshoot to fill the frame with a little more mountain and a little less folliage.  I find myself looking at the branches when I really want to see that mountain!</td>', 'This is an inspirational view.  Black and white looks nice.  The snow on the mountain could be a little whiter and maybe you could crop or reshoot to fill the frame with a little more mountain and a little less folliage.  I find myself looking at the branches when I really want to see that mountain!', '2005-09-26 01:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1738441, 235926, 39349, '<td valign="top">Clever!</td>', 'Clever!', '2005-09-26 01:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1738442, 236210, 14736, '<td valign="top">Which anniversary do you give apples?  Just kidding.  Good composition, but it seems kinda flat.  I''m not exactly sure how to fix it, sometimes playing with curves in photoshop can do wonders...</td>', 'Which anniversary do you give apples?  Just kidding.  Good composition, but it seems kinda flat.  I''m not exactly sure how to fix it, sometimes playing with curves in photoshop can do wonders...', '2005-09-26 01:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
