(1738495, 235094, 41522, '<td valign="top">I can''t remember if this is Upper or Lower Slaughter ... it''s been 2 years since I was in the Cotswolds.  My 2 year old son did the walk between the two towns with my wife and I, all on his own.  Nice shot!!  Well composed.  I would have liked an angle that didn''t include the pole on the left.</td>', 'I can''t remember if this is Upper or Lower Slaughter ... it''s been 2 years since I was in the Cotswolds.  My 2 year old son did the walk between the two towns with my wife and I, all on his own.  Nice shot!!  Well composed.  I would have liked an angle that didn''t include the pole on the left.', '2005-09-26 01:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1738498, 236211, 41522, '<td valign="top">This looks to be a nice shot, but I really can''t rate it due to the small size.</td>', 'This looks to be a nice shot, but I really can''t rate it due to the small size.', '2005-09-26 01:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1738501, 235694, 14736, '<td valign="top">This photo has too much of a snapshot quality and I''m not too excited about the oval border.  Try experimenting with different points of view and compositions and never forget: anything bathed in the golden light of sunset looks better.</td>', 'This photo has too much of a snapshot quality and I''m not too excited about the oval border.  Try experimenting with different points of view and compositions and never forget: anything bathed in the golden light of sunset looks better.', '2005-09-26 01:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1738503, 235807, 41522, '<td valign="top">I think it fits the challenge and the title is appropriate.  Sweet kid.  The light above her head is a bit of a distraction and I would like to have seen this a bit bigger.</td>', 'I think it fits the challenge and the title is appropriate.  Sweet kid.  The light above her head is a bit of a distraction and I would like to have seen this a bit bigger.', '2005-09-26 01:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
