(1739537, 236247, 2553, '<td valign="top">The lighting isn''t the greatest, and the orange blanket (or whatever it is) is very distracting, but you know what - I don''t care a bit!  This is so cute, the look on that little face looks so pitiful that it just doesn''t matter.  Only the emotional reaction to it does - and it''s adorable!</td>', 'The lighting isn''t the greatest, and the orange blanket (or whatever it is) is very distracting, but you know what - I don''t care a bit!  This is so cute, the look on that little face looks so pitiful that it just doesn''t matter.  Only the emotional reaction to it does - and it''s adorable!', '2005-09-26 11:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
