(1739544, 235743, 34759, '<td valign="top">Nice. Some people might tell you that you should have upped the contrast, but I like that lower contrast look for this. It makes it look old fashioned or something.</td>', 'Nice. Some people might tell you that you should have upped the contrast, but I like that lower contrast look for this. It makes it look old fashioned or something.', '2005-09-26 11:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
