(1739636, 235645, 18349, '<td valign="top">I think I recognize this gazebo and the processing as being a deapee shot but I could be wrong ;)   I like the location a lot, but I''m not too sure about the centered composition for this one.  I also think the water and shoreline are a bit icky, especially for a "thinking of you" card.  I might suggest a crop on the bottom to get rid of the shoreline, and possibly up into the water past the first dark green patch.  I think there are lots of opportunities for shots at this location, perhaps with more perspective and depth rather than more of a flat-on approach.  I do like the processing and the colors.  :)</td>', 'I think I recognize this gazebo and the processing as being a deapee shot but I could be wrong ;)   I like the location a lot, but I''m not too sure about the centered composition for this one.  I also think the water and shoreline are a bit icky, especially for a "thinking of you" card.  I might suggest a crop on the bottom to get rid of the shoreline, and possibly up into the water past the first dark green patch.  I think there are lots of opportunities for shots at this location, perhaps with more perspective and depth rather than more of a flat-on approach.  I do like the processing and the colors.  :)', '2005-09-26 12:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
