(1739881, 235902, 44776, '<td valign="top">A pretty rose, but the leaf on the right and part of the stem appear to be in better focus than the flower petals themselves.</td>', 'A pretty rose, but the leaf on the right and part of the stem appear to be in better focus than the flower petals themselves.', '2005-09-26 14:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1739882, 236260, 41522, '<td valign="top">A really nice shot.  I like the tones and the texture.  The lower part of the image is really nice, but I find the upper part to be a little distracting.  It may be the brightness of the water or the slight lack of focus, I''m not sure.</td>', 'A really nice shot.  I like the tones and the texture.  The lower part of the image is really nice, but I find the upper part to be a little distracting.  It may be the brightness of the water or the slight lack of focus, I''m not sure.', '2005-09-26 14:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1739883, 235729, 44776, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp focus and compsition.</td>', 'Nice sharp focus and compsition.', '2005-09-26 14:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1739884, 236226, 44776, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and quite punny too.  I like the depth of field.</td>', 'Nice capture and quite punny too.  I like the depth of field.', '2005-09-26 14:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1739887, 236153, 44776, '<td valign="top">I''m not much up on the holiday, but quite a collection.  The focus starts behind the front row of flowers, otherwise depth of field looks ok.</td>', 'I''m not much up on the holiday, but quite a collection.  The focus starts behind the front row of flowers, otherwise depth of field looks ok.', '2005-09-26 14:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1739890, 236253, 44776, '<td valign="top">I like the shot.  The unringing phone, and the appropriate music included improves it also.</td>', 'I like the shot.  The unringing phone, and the appropriate music included improves it also.', '2005-09-26 14:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1739893, 235743, 44776, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.  The long bench makes me think you could send the card to several friends at the same time  :)</td>', 'Nice picture.  The long bench makes me think you could send the card to several friends at the same time  :)', '2005-09-26 14:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1739898, 235694, 28299, '<td valign="top">Nice textures - 8</td>', 'Nice textures - 8', '2005-09-26 14:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1739901, 235997, 3102, '<td valign="top">Ok, I rarely use the "LOL" abbreviation, but I actually did laugh out loud at this one.  Very, very cute!</td>', 'Ok, I rarely use the "LOL" abbreviation, but I actually did laugh out loud at this one.  Very, very cute!', '2005-09-26 14:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1739904, 235997, 28299, '<td valign="top">hahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahaha!!!!!<br/>LMAO! Fantastic! And just where are your stitiches? Never mind, I don''t want to know! - 10</td>', 'hahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahaha!!!!!LMAO! Fantastic! And just where are your stitiches? Never mind, I don''t want to know! - 10', '2005-09-26 14:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1739906, 236253, 3102, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot... I might have gone without a couple of the items on the right, though.  I think the Green Day album, etc., could have probably been left out and it would have still been just as effective.</td>', 'I like this a lot... I might have gone without a couple of the items on the right, though.  I think the Green Day album, etc., could have probably been left out and it would have still been just as effective.', '2005-09-26 14:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1739908, 236260, 3032, '<td valign="top">When I was browsing the thumbnails for this challenge even the thumb shouted "Sher Hogue!"<br/>Pbase said I was right :)<br/>I like the concept and processing but I am a little bit unsure about the inclusion of the water at the top. On one hand it looks like you are at the end of the beach, far, far away but on the other hand it (the water) is so bright and lacks a bit of contrast.<br/>Thanks for the card, I''m thinking of you too. :))</td>', 'When I was browsing the thumbnails for this challenge even the thumb shouted "Sher Hogue!"Pbase said I was right :)I like the concept and processing but I am a little bit unsure about the inclusion of the water at the top. On one hand it looks like you are at the end of the beach, far, far away but on the other hand it (the water) is so bright and lacks a bit of contrast.Thanks for the card, I''m thinking of you too. :))', '2005-09-26 14:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1739914, 236322, 10080, '<td valign="top">Just a wonderful shot! Should be a winner from what I have seen! 10</td>', 'Just a wonderful shot! Should be a winner from what I have seen! 10', '2005-09-26 14:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1739922, 236201, 28299, '<td valign="top">A little more lighting on this (maybe a curves adjustment) to up the contrast and this would have been a real cutie!</td>', 'A little more lighting on this (maybe a curves adjustment) to up the contrast and this would have been a real cutie!', '2005-09-26 14:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1739924, 236074, 28299, '<td valign="top">Love the creative style, just not sure that the froggy adds anything. 7</td>', 'Love the creative style, just not sure that the froggy adds anything. 7', '2005-09-26 14:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1739926, 234294, 41802, '<td valign="top">Wow the lighting is prefect, great idea</td>', 'Wow the lighting is prefect, great idea', '2005-09-26 14:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1739927, 235519, 28299, '<td valign="top">Mazel Tov! 8</td>', 'Mazel Tov! 8', '2005-09-26 14:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1739934, 236289, 41522, '<td valign="top">Overall, a nice photo and a good fit into the challenge.  I really like the shallow DOF.  A minor point ... There is small dot along the top of the image that looks like a dust spot or maybe an imperfection on the flower.</td>', 'Overall, a nice photo and a good fit into the challenge.  I really like the shallow DOF.  A minor point ... There is small dot along the top of the image that looks like a dust spot or maybe an imperfection on the flower.', '2005-09-26 14:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1739964, 235621, 36981, '<td valign="top">I wish this were larger, and a sharper focus.</td>', 'I wish this were larger, and a sharper focus.', '2005-09-26 14:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
