(1740089, 235529, 19672, '<td valign="top">You do realize, that this qualifies as "cruelty to animals"</td>', 'You do realize, that this qualifies as "cruelty to animals"', '2005-09-26 16:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1740095, 235621, 19672, '<td valign="top">This is probably going to score really low...<br/> <br/>Don''t be discouraged. DPC is very harsh to blurriness and out of focus shots. The crop is a bit too tight.<br/> <br/>However, for all the harsh criticisms I''ve received and low scoring entries. Realize, that a year of being on this site improved my photography by leaps and bounds. Enough so that numerous friends have commented on it. Including one friend who used to be a photographer commenting that I''ve improved quite a bit.</td>', 'This is probably going to score really low... Don''t be discouraged. DPC is very harsh to blurriness and out of focus shots. The crop is a bit too tight. However, for all the harsh criticisms I''ve received and low scoring entries. Realize, that a year of being on this site improved my photography by leaps and bounds. Enough so that numerous friends have commented on it. Including one friend who used to be a photographer commenting that I''ve improved quite a bit.', '2005-09-26 16:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1740126, 236346, 10732, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2005-09-26 16:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1740128, 236166, 10732, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of the photo</td>', 'I like the simplicity of the photo', '2005-09-26 16:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1740151, 235029, 23430, '<td valign="top">Nice colours</td>', 'Nice colours', '2005-09-26 17:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1740154, 236074, 41522, '<td valign="top">I think this works as a greeting card.  The composition is nice and the red colours realy stand out nicely.  For a greeting card, Ithink that the grain works.</td>', 'I think this works as a greeting card.  The composition is nice and the red colours realy stand out nicely.  For a greeting card, Ithink that the grain works.', '2005-09-26 17:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1740162, 236332, 23430, '<td valign="top">Great border and good concept.</td>', 'Great border and good concept.', '2005-09-26 17:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1740185, 236211, 35645, '<td valign="top">I apologize ahead of time, but I am going to be blunt. This photo shows great potential on your part toward becoming a good photographer (or better). The composition is nice, and is definately something I would expect to see on a greeting card. However... (and I know others are going to say this) I would like to SEE the photo - this one is too small! Your horizon is slightly off (by a couple of degrees). The purply-pink cast to the photo adds nothing; it simply looks as though it''s been over-processed, possibly to hide other technical flaws. There seems to be a lot of detail lost in the shadow of the rocks, and there''s something lurking in the water on the left side of the photo that I can''t make out (and is therefore distracting). This shot could be so much better, and I think you probably have the ability to make it so - you certainly seem to have an ''eye'' for what looks good.</td>', 'I apologize ahead of time, but I am going to be blunt. This photo shows great potential on your part toward becoming a good photographer (or better). The composition is nice, and is definately something I would expect to see on a greeting card. However... (and I know others are going to say this) I would like to SEE the photo - this one is too small! Your horizon is slightly off (by a couple of degrees). The purply-pink cast to the photo adds nothing; it simply looks as though it''s been over-processed, possibly to hide other technical flaws. There seems to be a lot of detail lost in the shadow of the rocks, and there''s something lurking in the water on the left side of the photo that I can''t make out (and is therefore distracting). This shot could be so much better, and I think you probably have the ability to make it so - you certainly seem to have an ''eye'' for what looks good.', '2005-09-26 17:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1740192, 234137, 35645, '<td valign="top">I like the concept. Unfortunately, the small size of the entry makes it very difficult to see what is going on.</td>', 'I like the concept. Unfortunately, the small size of the entry makes it very difficult to see what is going on.', '2005-09-26 17:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1740205, 235880, 35645, '<td valign="top">I understand the concept of giving flowers (even on a card) as a get-well-gift, but these flowers look like they''ve gone a few rounds with my four-year-old. On a technical note, the light from the on-camera flash is very harsh; perhaps you could soften it a bit next time by taping tissue paper or a plastic spoon over the flash. The background is very distracting - I keep trying to figure out what it is rather than simply taking in the photo.</td>', 'I understand the concept of giving flowers (even on a card) as a get-well-gift, but these flowers look like they''ve gone a few rounds with my four-year-old. On a technical note, the light from the on-camera flash is very harsh; perhaps you could soften it a bit next time by taping tissue paper or a plastic spoon over the flash. The background is very distracting - I keep trying to figure out what it is rather than simply taking in the photo.', '2005-09-26 17:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1740218, 235027, 35645, '<td valign="top">Not sure that the title is a category of greeting card, but not taking off for that. The silhouette is nice (if a little fuzzy), but the sun is WAAAAYYYYY blown out (I know it''s a difficult subject). This photo would probably work a little better and be more visually appealing if you were to crop out the sun and perhaps include a little more of the skyline to the left. Your horizon is tilted. On a good note, the colors in the sky (other than the sun) are beautiful, and I like having the sailboat in the foreground. The placement of your horizon is also good.</td>', 'Not sure that the title is a category of greeting card, but not taking off for that. The silhouette is nice (if a little fuzzy), but the sun is WAAAAYYYYY blown out (I know it''s a difficult subject). This photo would probably work a little better and be more visually appealing if you were to crop out the sun and perhaps include a little more of the skyline to the left. Your horizon is tilted. On a good note, the colors in the sky (other than the sun) are beautiful, and I like having the sailboat in the foreground. The placement of your horizon is also good.', '2005-09-26 17:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1740228, 236168, 31708, '<td valign="top">GREAT COLORS IN TH E TREES !</td>', 'GREAT COLORS IN TH E TREES !', '2005-09-26 17:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1740297, 233958, 18552, '<td valign="top">How very, very lovely.</td>', 'How very, very lovely.', '2005-09-26 18:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
