(1740426, 236353, 44776, '<td valign="top">I''m curious what this would look like in color, it looks like a beautiful location. The blurry foreground is distracting to me.</td>', 'I''m curious what this would look like in color, it looks like a beautiful location. The blurry foreground is distracting to me.', '2005-09-26 19:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1740430, 235281, 31831, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a bit bright.The subjects are clear. I like how a few appear to be ''looking'' around.</td>', 'Lighting is a bit bright.The subjects are clear. I like how a few appear to be ''looking'' around.', '2005-09-26 19:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1740431, 235883, 44776, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of the light at the end of the tunnel.  In a hospital setting "going to the light" has a bad meaning.  For me there is just too much black.</td>', 'This reminds me of the light at the end of the tunnel.  In a hospital setting "going to the light" has a bad meaning.  For me there is just too much black.', '2005-09-26 19:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
