(1740496, 236349, 34759, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot! I love it. The only thing I would have done differently, is clone out the little pieces of wing in the sky on the left and right sides and maybe cropped or cloned out the bird on the very top.</td>', 'Very nice shot! I love it. The only thing I would have done differently, is clone out the little pieces of wing in the sky on the left and right sides and maybe cropped or cloned out the bird on the very top.', '2005-09-26 19:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
