(1741531, 236182, 19831, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot. I love your treatment of the photo. Very nice.</td>', 'Wonderful shot. I love your treatment of the photo. Very nice.', '2005-09-27 04:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1741537, 236361, 19831, '<td valign="top">This looks like a nice scene. Seems like this shot could be a little sharper. Also, there appears to be some problems with the exposure here. Looks like a tough situation, the shadows are underexposed, no detail there, and then that very harsh light on the open grass in the middle ground is distracting. Also there seems to be a lot of blue in the rocks and some of the trees. Maybe taking this shot at a different time of day could be beneficial, with different lighting conditions. Maybe some tweaking in the editing could help also.</td>', 'This looks like a nice scene. Seems like this shot could be a little sharper. Also, there appears to be some problems with the exposure here. Looks like a tough situation, the shadows are underexposed, no detail there, and then that very harsh light on the open grass in the middle ground is distracting. Also there seems to be a lot of blue in the rocks and some of the trees. Maybe taking this shot at a different time of day could be beneficial, with different lighting conditions. Maybe some tweaking in the editing could help also.', '2005-09-27 04:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1741539, 234390, 19831, '<td valign="top">This is a cute capture. Focus looks like it could be a little stronger though. Has a kind of ''cluttered'' look to it. Perhaps a different angle could strengthen the presentation here. It has the appearance that one just came across the scene and snapped a shot of it.</td>', 'This is a cute capture. Focus looks like it could be a little stronger though. Has a kind of ''cluttered'' look to it. Perhaps a different angle could strengthen the presentation here. It has the appearance that one just came across the scene and snapped a shot of it.', '2005-09-27 04:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
