(1742110, 236153, 15711, '<td valign="top">This really does look like a greeting card set up.  I''m glad you chose a different category as well. It is a bit busy, but considering the subject matter, it works.  Nice composition and clarity.</td>', 'This really does look like a greeting card set up.  I''m glad you chose a different category as well. It is a bit busy, but considering the subject matter, it works.  Nice composition and clarity.', '2005-09-27 12:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1742115, 236202, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think the composition of this is a tad busy. The ceramic sculpture in the lower part is too distracting and doesn''t add to the shot at all. What if you cropped to just below the dove on the ledge?  I still think it would work and you could even zoom in more on the bird. AS it is, there is so much going on, that there isn''t a place for the eye to rest. I don''t really see the connection between friendship and a dove with some garden statuary but that''s not the point. The clarity and focus is there. The lighting is good.  Just delete some of it, or shoot in an area that has more solid surface, and I think you have a winner.</td>', 'I think the composition of this is a tad busy. The ceramic sculpture in the lower part is too distracting and doesn''t add to the shot at all. What if you cropped to just below the dove on the ledge?  I still think it would work and you could even zoom in more on the bird. AS it is, there is so much going on, that there isn''t a place for the eye to rest. I don''t really see the connection between friendship and a dove with some garden statuary but that''s not the point. The clarity and focus is there. The lighting is good.  Just delete some of it, or shoot in an area that has more solid surface, and I think you have a winner.', '2005-09-27 12:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1742119, 236362, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen a wild life category, but if I had, this would certainly work. The greens and yellows are very striking.  The lighting showcases his skin very well. I might blur out the background a bit as it is a bit distracting.  I think "Hang In There" would have worked too. hee hee</td>', 'I''ve never seen a wild life category, but if I had, this would certainly work. The greens and yellows are very striking.  The lighting showcases his skin very well. I might blur out the background a bit as it is a bit distracting.  I think "Hang In There" would have worked too. hee hee', '2005-09-27 12:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
