(1744116, 235851, 25655, '<td valign="top">One of the more emotive cards of the challenge!<br/>There are so many different meanings to this picture. <br/>I love the quality of the photograph, as the fron flower is in perfect focus and the back looks more like a painting. (and I always love shallow DOF shots)<br/>But what''s making it so unique IMO is the colors. The bright colors of the front flower bursting through the gray... <br/> <br/>I hope you make this one available for prints, incase I need a sympathy card.</td>', 'One of the more emotive cards of the challenge!There are so many different meanings to this picture. I love the quality of the photograph, as the fron flower is in perfect focus and the back looks more like a painting. (and I always love shallow DOF shots)But what''s making it so unique IMO is the colors. The bright colors of the front flower bursting through the gray...  I hope you make this one available for prints, incase I need a sympathy card.', '2005-09-28 02:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
