(1747629, 236365, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice concept. I really like how the blues tie everything together, the bike, his shirt, the water, sky. A nice feel to the color scheme of the whole photo. I think the comp might be a little stronger if the subject were framed closer to the left edge of the image, coming into the photo instead of going out, taking the viewers eye out of the shot.</td>', 'Nice concept. I really like how the blues tie everything together, the bike, his shirt, the water, sky. A nice feel to the color scheme of the whole photo. I think the comp might be a little stronger if the subject were framed closer to the left edge of the image, coming into the photo instead of going out, taking the viewers eye out of the shot.', '2005-09-29 07:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
