(1747631, 236244, 19831, '<td valign="top">Good compositionally. Looks a bit oversharpened to me.</td>', 'Good compositionally. Looks a bit oversharpened to me.', '2005-09-29 07:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747632, 234294, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cute idea. Good lighting. I could see this as a card :-)</td>', 'Very cute idea. Good lighting. I could see this as a card :-)', '2005-09-29 07:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747640, 235880, 19831, '<td valign="top">A good idea, fits the challenge well. The flowers have some vivid color, but overall the exposure or lighting feels kind of off, maybe you used on board flash? <br/>I can''t tell if the background is wood, or what, but it seems a little distracting. Good focus and clarity, but overall, I find my eye struggling to find a strong point of interest in the shot. I realize the arrangement overall is the subject, but in this case, it feels lacking, and I as the viewer, am wandering, searching over the image. Perhaps there is just a little too much, too busy. Some of the flowers look kind of droopy and ill.</td>', 'A good idea, fits the challenge well. The flowers have some vivid color, but overall the exposure or lighting feels kind of off, maybe you used on board flash? I can''t tell if the background is wood, or what, but it seems a little distracting. Good focus and clarity, but overall, I find my eye struggling to find a strong point of interest in the shot. I realize the arrangement overall is the subject, but in this case, it feels lacking, and I as the viewer, am wandering, searching over the image. Perhaps there is just a little too much, too busy. Some of the flowers look kind of droopy and ill.', '2005-09-29 08:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747643, 236322, 35161, '<td valign="top">Lol! Wonderful! Too funny and sweet! :D</td>', 'Lol! Wonderful! Too funny and sweet! :D', '2005-09-29 08:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747648, 236300, 19831, '<td valign="top">Kind of a fun image, but the huge white (and un even) border seems a bit distracting.</td>', 'Kind of a fun image, but the huge white (and un even) border seems a bit distracting.', '2005-09-29 08:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747653, 236243, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cute child. A good idea, and I like the background. I assume the blur is intentional, but in this case, it seems like just too much, or not working for the image. A slightly tighter crop might strengthen the presentation also, IMO.</td>', 'Very cute child. A good idea, and I like the background. I assume the blur is intentional, but in this case, it seems like just too much, or not working for the image. A slightly tighter crop might strengthen the presentation also, IMO.', '2005-09-29 08:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747657, 236332, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very good idea. Fits the challenge well, IMO. Good composition. I think the soft focus/blur works well with the image in this case. I wish that wasn''t a brick wall out the window, it gives kind of a restraining feeling to the concept of the cat looking out at the world for who it misses, if you know what I mean? , and it has that hot spot that seems harsh against the nice gentle softness of the photo.</td>', 'Very good idea. Fits the challenge well, IMO. Good composition. I think the soft focus/blur works well with the image in this case. I wish that wasn''t a brick wall out the window, it gives kind of a restraining feeling to the concept of the cat looking out at the world for who it misses, if you know what I mean? , and it has that hot spot that seems harsh against the nice gentle softness of the photo.', '2005-09-29 08:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747659, 235208, 37790, '<td valign="top">This one is so cute<br/>Love it</td>', 'This one is so cuteLove it', '2005-09-29 08:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
