(1749263, 236132, 44743, '<td valign="top">That you can''t tell where one house ends and the next begins makes for a fun image of seemingly endless houses.  However, I would think a card celebrating a person''s new home would want to emphasize how special / unique the new home was, rather than hinting that "all houses are the same".</td>', 'That you can''t tell where one house ends and the next begins makes for a fun image of seemingly endless houses.  However, I would think a card celebrating a person''s new home would want to emphasize how special / unique the new home was, rather than hinting that "all houses are the same".', '2005-09-29 21:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
