(1749279, 236032, 44743, '<td valign="top">It''s a pretty shot. But the fact that it''s a fake flower in a friendship card seems to send the wrong message.  I think I would prefer a genuine flower, even if it wasn''t as perfect.</td>', 'It''s a pretty shot. But the fact that it''s a fake flower in a friendship card seems to send the wrong message.  I think I would prefer a genuine flower, even if it wasn''t as perfect.', '2005-09-29 21:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749280, 236001, 3554, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept with the title, but the picture doesn''t have the traditional greeting card dimensions which makes it harder for me to visualize as a card. Also the pig you''re using isn''t a very interesting/eye catching model so I think that also detracts a little bit from what you are trying to do.</td>', 'I really like the concept with the title, but the picture doesn''t have the traditional greeting card dimensions which makes it harder for me to visualize as a card. Also the pig you''re using isn''t a very interesting/eye catching model so I think that also detracts a little bit from what you are trying to do.', '2005-09-29 21:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749284, 236086, 3554, '<td valign="top">Not a bad concept -- lots of candles and the party plate. But the use of a twinkie doesn''t seem to add anything to the shot. Also I''m not sure all the dripping wax really helps. If you were trying to use the wax to communicate something specific I don''t really get it.</td>', 'Not a bad concept -- lots of candles and the party plate. But the use of a twinkie doesn''t seem to add anything to the shot. Also I''m not sure all the dripping wax really helps. If you were trying to use the wax to communicate something specific I don''t really get it.', '2005-09-29 22:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749286, 235281, 44743, '<td valign="top">I think it was a nice shot, and I like the black and white, but it seems too overexposed.</td>', 'I think it was a nice shot, and I like the black and white, but it seems too overexposed.', '2005-09-29 22:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749288, 235873, 44743, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  The "lone frog" works well for the card. I know it''s hard to control these "living" shots, but it would have been nice to see a bit more of the frogs face.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  The "lone frog" works well for the card. I know it''s hard to control these "living" shots, but it would have been nice to see a bit more of the frogs face.', '2005-09-29 22:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749289, 235878, 3554, '<td valign="top">The setup of the ornaments is sort of flat and uninteresting. I like the use of color agaisnt white and your lighting is well done, but the final result is simply an overhead shot of three rather uninteresting oranaments. Decent execution, but not a lot in and of the shot to hold my interest. Perhaps if you had strung them up with fishing line and shot them in the air with more distance between them and the background you would have more depth and more interest?</td>', 'The setup of the ornaments is sort of flat and uninteresting. I like the use of color agaisnt white and your lighting is well done, but the final result is simply an overhead shot of three rather uninteresting oranaments. Decent execution, but not a lot in and of the shot to hold my interest. Perhaps if you had strung them up with fishing line and shot them in the air with more distance between them and the background you would have more depth and more interest?', '2005-09-29 22:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749290, 235358, 41802, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea, the lighting and coloring are prefect!</td>', 'This is a great idea, the lighting and coloring are prefect!', '2005-09-29 22:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
