(1749677, 235003, 33947, '<td valign="top">Great colors and relections. Nice composition. 10</td>', 'Great colors and relections. Nice composition. 10', '2005-09-30 00:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749684, 236285, 33947, '<td valign="top">Love the contrast and vibrant colors and clarity. One of my favorites. 10</td>', 'Love the contrast and vibrant colors and clarity. One of my favorites. 10', '2005-09-30 00:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749685, 236346, 33947, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shading and color.</td>', 'Beautiful shading and color.', '2005-09-30 00:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749797, 236160, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Great set up. Nice lighting. Awesome use of dof. Real good color. Great Job!</td>', 'Very nice shot. Great set up. Nice lighting. Awesome use of dof. Real good color. Great Job!', '2005-09-30 02:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749806, 235467, 19831, '<td valign="top">I think this is a good concept, and fits the challenge well. I''m feeling that it could be strengthened in it''s presentation though. The lighting seems a little flat. Perhaps shooting at a different time, catching a more acute angle of light, it could add some shadows to the statue, showing some texture and creating a sense of depth. I''m also thinking maybe if the frame didn''t cut off the feet/base of the statue it could help. And, maybe a more dramatic angle/pov would be more stimulating.</td>', 'I think this is a good concept, and fits the challenge well. I''m feeling that it could be strengthened in it''s presentation though. The lighting seems a little flat. Perhaps shooting at a different time, catching a more acute angle of light, it could add some shadows to the statue, showing some texture and creating a sense of depth. I''m also thinking maybe if the frame didn''t cut off the feet/base of the statue it could help. And, maybe a more dramatic angle/pov would be more stimulating.', '2005-09-30 02:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749814, 236134, 19831, '<td valign="top">This is awesome! I''m sorry, but it gives me quite a smile :-) Great lighting and clarity, good composition, overall technically very sound. Super idea. I really like how you''ve tied in the blues. Her expression is great. (that''s why I said I''m sorry, she really looks like she doesn''t feel very well) :-)  Love the ice bag on her head, perfect touch. Only suggestion for improvement I can thing of would be to use the old style thermometer instead of a modern digital one, it might tie in with the ice bag better. And I could definitely see this as a card! Awesome job! One of my favs of this challenge.</td>', 'This is awesome! I''m sorry, but it gives me quite a smile :-) Great lighting and clarity, good composition, overall technically very sound. Super idea. I really like how you''ve tied in the blues. Her expression is great. (that''s why I said I''m sorry, she really looks like she doesn''t feel very well) :-)  Love the ice bag on her head, perfect touch. Only suggestion for improvement I can thing of would be to use the old style thermometer instead of a modern digital one, it might tie in with the ice bag better. And I could definitely see this as a card! Awesome job! One of my favs of this challenge.', '2005-09-30 02:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749905, 236353, 16046, '<td valign="top">Looks like Mt Adams, nice image</td>', 'Looks like Mt Adams, nice image', '2005-09-30 05:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749949, 235735, 3306, '<td valign="top">A beauty.</td>', 'A beauty.', '2005-09-30 07:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749950, 236332, 3306, '<td valign="top">Nice. I like the Gaussian Blur on this one</td>', 'Nice. I like the Gaussian Blur on this one', '2005-09-30 07:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749951, 236033, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very succint. Excellent portrayal of the theme.</td>', 'Very succint. Excellent portrayal of the theme.', '2005-09-30 07:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749952, 235911, 3306, '<td valign="top">Good one. I like the touch of shadows. Not an easy capture to get right.</td>', 'Good one. I like the touch of shadows. Not an easy capture to get right.', '2005-09-30 07:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749955, 236252, 3306, '<td valign="top">Good head on shot. Would have liked it better without the border.</td>', 'Good head on shot. Would have liked it better without the border.', '2005-09-30 07:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749956, 236032, 3306, '<td valign="top">The aritificial nature of the flower suggests an artificial friendship. A real flower would have worked better. Nice shot though.</td>', 'The aritificial nature of the flower suggests an artificial friendship. A real flower would have worked better. Nice shot though.', '2005-09-30 07:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749958, 235879, 35517, '<td valign="top">OMG this is just adorable.. what a great shot... well done.. i really hope this ribbons... 10 for sure..... love it...</td>', 'OMG this is just adorable.. what a great shot... well done.. i really hope this ribbons... 10 for sure..... love it...', '2005-09-30 07:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749959, 235208, 92, '<td valign="top">PERFECT 10</td>', 'PERFECT 10', '2005-09-30 08:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749960, 236182, 92, '<td valign="top">I love the tones ! This is awesome ! 10</td>', 'I love the tones ! This is awesome ! 10', '2005-09-30 08:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749964, 235890, 92, '<td valign="top">Beautiful ... nicely done !</td>', 'Beautiful ... nicely done !', '2005-09-30 08:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749966, 236145, 92, '<td valign="top">Superb 10 !</td>', 'Superb 10 !', '2005-09-30 08:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749971, 236032, 35602, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the fact that this is a fabric rose kind of wrecks it for me.  If this were a real rose, I would have graded it higher.  If this were to be used for a card, I think the only way you could get away with using a fabric rose is to texturize the entire image to appear like a woven image.</td>', 'Good idea, but the fact that this is a fabric rose kind of wrecks it for me.  If this were a real rose, I would have graded it higher.  If this were to be used for a card, I think the only way you could get away with using a fabric rose is to texturize the entire image to appear like a woven image.', '2005-09-30 08:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749972, 236107, 35602, '<td valign="top">The image is beautiful.  I love the blue color.  The background bothers me, though.  Use of shallow depth of field was very good.  Wouldn''t have made it any clearer.  I think a little backlighting on the thistle would have brought it away from the background better, to make it really stand out.</td>', 'The image is beautiful.  I love the blue color.  The background bothers me, though.  Use of shallow depth of field was very good.  Wouldn''t have made it any clearer.  I think a little backlighting on the thistle would have brought it away from the background better, to make it really stand out.', '2005-09-30 08:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749974, 236203, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of graduated depth of field.</td>', 'Very nice use of graduated depth of field.', '2005-09-30 08:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749975, 235409, 92, '<td valign="top">PERFECT 10 !</td>', 'PERFECT 10 !', '2005-09-30 08:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749977, 236173, 35602, '<td valign="top">This is a great image.  I think that this would make a better retirement card, though.  I would get this one if it was a retirement card, but as a bon voyage, I don''t think so.  I will give you a 7 though for the picture itself.</td>', 'This is a great image.  I think that this would make a better retirement card, though.  I would get this one if it was a retirement card, but as a bon voyage, I don''t think so.  I will give you a 7 though for the picture itself.', '2005-09-30 08:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749978, 236284, 92, '<td valign="top">GREAT card for a man. They can can be hard to find a times. Well done</td>', 'GREAT card for a man. They can can be hard to find a times. Well done', '2005-09-30 08:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749980, 235358, 92, '<td valign="top">hahaha LOVE it ! 10</td>', 'hahaha LOVE it ! 10', '2005-09-30 08:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749981, 236134, 35602, '<td valign="top">There is red eye in this one, but I am sure you''ve been told that.  It may have been a creative tool to create a really red look, but I think it would have been better if the red eye had been fixed.  The red nose and thermometer and messy hair would have been adequate.</td>', 'There is red eye in this one, but I am sure you''ve been told that.  It may have been a creative tool to create a really red look, but I think it would have been better if the red eye had been fixed.  The red nose and thermometer and messy hair would have been adequate.', '2005-09-30 08:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750020, 235997, 25355, '<td valign="top">Pity about the bright highlight of the shoes, but great idea.</td>', 'Pity about the bright highlight of the shoes, but great idea.', '2005-09-30 09:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750024, 235535, 25355, '<td valign="top">Great use of colour, lovely and bright.</td>', 'Great use of colour, lovely and bright.', '2005-09-30 09:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750058, 236365, 31403, '<td valign="top">more saturation would make this stronger for me</td>', 'more saturation would make this stronger for me', '2005-09-30 09:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750063, 236243, 31403, '<td valign="top">feels out of focus to me</td>', 'feels out of focus to me', '2005-09-30 10:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750069, 236066, 31403, '<td valign="top">love the sharp focus</td>', 'love the sharp focus', '2005-09-30 10:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750075, 236226, 31403, '<td valign="top">I''m generally no fan of bug photos - but this is pretty amazing - I would have tried cropping right down to the amazing part, all the background to the left just dillutes your image IMO - maybe a skosh brighter? - great timing though</td>', 'I''m generally no fan of bug photos - but this is pretty amazing - I would have tried cropping right down to the amazing part, all the background to the left just dillutes your image IMO - maybe a skosh brighter? - great timing though', '2005-09-30 10:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750078, 236260, 31403, '<td valign="top">looks like a card to me, love the tonal range - 8</td>', 'looks like a card to me, love the tonal range - 8', '2005-09-30 10:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750081, 235656, 31403, '<td valign="top">great personality here, love it - 8 for now</td>', 'great personality here, love it - 8 for now', '2005-09-30 10:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750085, 236285, 31403, '<td valign="top">great focus, leaves feel a little hot to me - border hurts me - really nice work though</td>', 'great focus, leaves feel a little hot to me - border hurts me - really nice work though', '2005-09-30 10:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750091, 235432, 31403, '<td valign="top">these are very difficult figures to photograph, I think you''ve done a great job - 7</td>', 'these are very difficult figures to photograph, I think you''ve done a great job - 7', '2005-09-30 10:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750093, 236136, 31403, '<td valign="top">stunning, a card I would buy - and that''s saying something (not a card guy).  Love the colors - 9 for now</td>', 'stunning, a card I would buy - and that''s saying something (not a card guy).  Love the colors - 9 for now', '2005-09-30 10:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750095, 234294, 31403, '<td valign="top">hard to shoot a white rabbit on a white background - top of his head blends pretty well witht he background.  The bear with the bandaids is a pretty cute image by itself - this is great creative - 7</td>', 'hard to shoot a white rabbit on a white background - top of his head blends pretty well witht he background.  The bear with the bandaids is a pretty cute image by itself - this is great creative - 7', '2005-09-30 10:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750098, 235487, 31403, '<td valign="top">those bright leaves in the top center are bright enough to draw my attention, maybe burn those hightlights a tad to draw attention back to the falls? - it''s a beautiful photo and really nice work</td>', 'those bright leaves in the top center are bright enough to draw my attention, maybe burn those hightlights a tad to draw attention back to the falls? - it''s a beautiful photo and really nice work', '2005-09-30 10:30:03.000000', NULL, 1);
