(1750100, 236346, 31403, '<td valign="top">technically stunning photo - the pose makes me want to gag - but I guess the girls will love it for many reasons - 8</td>', 'technically stunning photo - the pose makes me want to gag - but I guess the girls will love it for many reasons - 8', '2005-09-30 10:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750103, 236057, 31403, '<td valign="top">beautiful, 8</td>', 'beautiful, 8', '2005-09-30 10:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750108, 234752, 31403, '<td valign="top">an orange duck for fathers day - something I might never have thought of!  beautiful colors in a strange way - I really like it - 8</td>', 'an orange duck for fathers day - something I might never have thought of!  beautiful colors in a strange way - I really like it - 8', '2005-09-30 10:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750112, 235003, 31403, '<td valign="top">love it - the colors fit your title very well, excellent 9</td>', 'love it - the colors fit your title very well, excellent 9', '2005-09-30 10:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750128, 236074, 31403, '<td valign="top">thank you for being different - I love the texture, the dark shapes in the background puzzle me and draw my attention from a terrific foreground.  The frog and the girl on a white background with that texture and you''ve got a 9 - 7 as is - nice work</td>', 'thank you for being different - I love the texture, the dark shapes in the background puzzle me and draw my attention from a terrific foreground.  The frog and the girl on a white background with that texture and you''ve got a 9 - 7 as is - nice work', '2005-09-30 10:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750173, 235306, 24913, '<td valign="top">wish the center was in focus, not the ends of the petals</td>', 'wish the center was in focus, not the ends of the petals', '2005-09-30 11:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750177, 236362, 23877, '<td valign="top">Thats a big pile of snake.Is he a type of Boa?</td>', 'Thats a big pile of snake.Is he a type of Boa?', '2005-09-30 11:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750178, 236068, 23877, '<td valign="top">Very nice Rainbow.9</td>', 'Very nice Rainbow.9', '2005-09-30 11:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750182, 236145, 23877, '<td valign="top">I love this,very well done.10</td>', 'I love this,very well done.10', '2005-09-30 11:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750184, 236001, 26255, '<td valign="top">Nice use of color.  Sharp image.</td>', 'Nice use of color.  Sharp image.', '2005-09-30 11:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750186, 235891, 26255, '<td valign="top">I like the use of B/W and the expression is good also, it''s just too blurry for my taste.</td>', 'I like the use of B/W and the expression is good also, it''s just too blurry for my taste.', '2005-09-30 11:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750187, 235281, 26255, '<td valign="top">I''m missing the reference, the highlights too blown out and the image is overall blurry.</td>', 'I''m missing the reference, the highlights too blown out and the image is overall blurry.', '2005-09-30 11:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750191, 234374, 26255, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, but I feel it would have much more "punch" if you had at least one person sitting in one of the chairs.  Also would suggest drying the chairs before taking the picture.  As it stands , the only thing this image conveys IMHO is.... The chairs are wet and nobody wants a wet butt, that''s why they''re empty</td>', 'Interesting concept, but I feel it would have much more "punch" if you had at least one person sitting in one of the chairs.  Also would suggest drying the chairs before taking the picture.  As it stands , the only thing this image conveys IMHO is.... The chairs are wet and nobody wants a wet butt, that''s why they''re empty', '2005-09-30 11:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750192, 236335, 26255, '<td valign="top">Nice use of DOF.  I love the expression and the way you''ve captured the dandelion "petals" mid-air.</td>', 'Nice use of DOF.  I love the expression and the way you''ve captured the dandelion "petals" mid-air.', '2005-09-30 11:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750194, 235472, 26255, '<td valign="top">The color seems "offish".  A bit too blue (possibly a WB issue).  The highlights are blown out and the focus seems a little soft.  Image has a lot more potential with a few minor adjustments in post-processing.  I''m not a big fan of the border either.</td>', 'The color seems "offish".  A bit too blue (possibly a WB issue).  The highlights are blown out and the focus seems a little soft.  Image has a lot more potential with a few minor adjustments in post-processing.  I''m not a big fan of the border either.', '2005-09-30 11:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750195, 236115, 26255, '<td valign="top">This one makes me smile.   Good clear focus and use of DOF.  Good shot!</td>', 'This one makes me smile.   Good clear focus and use of DOF.  Good shot!', '2005-09-30 11:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750196, 236305, 26255, '<td valign="top">The colors seem a bit muted (possibly due to haze).  Saturation adjustments could be made to make them "pop" a little more.  I like the contrast between the yellows and the greens.</td>', 'The colors seem a bit muted (possibly due to haze).  Saturation adjustments could be made to make them "pop" a little more.  I like the contrast between the yellows and the greens.', '2005-09-30 11:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750198, 234611, 23877, '<td valign="top">NICE CAPTURE.8</td>', 'NICE CAPTURE.8', '2005-09-30 11:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750199, 236032, 26255, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the reference here, particularly since you used an artificial flower.  The lighting seems OK, but I''m not a big fan of the border.</td>', 'Not sure about the reference here, particularly since you used an artificial flower.  The lighting seems OK, but I''m not a big fan of the border.', '2005-09-30 11:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750200, 235027, 26255, '<td valign="top">Image is a little small and the focus seems a little soft.  The brightness of the sun is overpowering and there seems to be a lens flare on the left side of the image.  i love the gradient of the sky from blue to orange. The horizon is a little tilted.  I think this would have more pizazz without the sun.</td>', 'Image is a little small and the focus seems a little soft.  The brightness of the sun is overpowering and there seems to be a lens flare on the left side of the image.  i love the gradient of the sky from blue to orange. The horizon is a little tilted.  I think this would have more pizazz without the sun.', '2005-09-30 11:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750202, 236184, 26255, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but find the shadows a little too harsh.  The hand looks a little "plasticy".  Maybe just a hair too much NI.</td>', 'I like the concept, but find the shadows a little too harsh.  The hand looks a little "plasticy".  Maybe just a hair too much NI.', '2005-09-30 11:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750203, 235535, 26255, '<td valign="top">I love the use of color and whitespace.  The smile seems genuine.  Good shot!</td>', 'I love the use of color and whitespace.  The smile seems genuine.  Good shot!', '2005-09-30 11:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750205, 234137, 26255, '<td valign="top">The image is way too small!  It''s impossible to see any details, but from what I can see, the focus seems a little soft.</td>', 'The image is way too small!  It''s impossible to see any details, but from what I can see, the focus seems a little soft.', '2005-09-30 11:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750207, 235167, 30945, '<td valign="top">what an awesome dog!!</td>', 'what an awesome dog!!', '2005-09-30 11:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750208, 234870, 26255, '<td valign="top">I''m missing the connection between an empty road and "Love:Missing You"  The image itself is OK and definately an interesting location.  This may have done better in the "Destinations" challenge.</td>', 'I''m missing the connection between an empty road and "Love:Missing You"  The image itself is OK and definately an interesting location.  This may have done better in the "Destinations" challenge.', '2005-09-30 11:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750210, 235859, 26255, '<td valign="top">Love those big brown eyes.   Adorable little girl, but the image seems a little "snapshot-like"  to me.</td>', 'Love those big brown eyes.   Adorable little girl, but the image seems a little "snapshot-like"  to me.', '2005-09-30 11:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750215, 236168, 26255, '<td valign="top">Stunning capture and I love the contrasting yellows and greens.  I think the image might do a little better without the little piece of sky at the top (the blue doesn''t blend well with the other colors IMHO).  I''m not sure this really says "Thinking of you" to me.</td>', 'Stunning capture and I love the contrasting yellows and greens.  I think the image might do a little better without the little piece of sky at the top (the blue doesn''t blend well with the other colors IMHO).  I''m not sure this really says "Thinking of you" to me.', '2005-09-30 11:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750218, 235516, 26255, '<td valign="top">Maybe in B/W?</td>', 'Maybe in B/W?', '2005-09-30 11:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750220, 235735, 26255, '<td valign="top">I like this... the bird really does seem to have that expression... I would like to see just a slightly tighter crop to bring more attention to the bird and less on the water.</td>', 'I like this... the bird really does seem to have that expression... I would like to see just a slightly tighter crop to bring more attention to the bird and less on the water.', '2005-09-30 11:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750223, 236271, 26255, '<td valign="top">Cute picture, focus seems a little soft</td>', 'Cute picture, focus seems a little soft', '2005-09-30 11:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750226, 236231, 26255, '<td valign="top">Yeah, I''m kind of drawing a blank on this one too.  The composition is OK, maybe cropped a little too tight on the left side.  The focus is very sharp, but the shadows are a little distracting.</td>', 'Yeah, I''m kind of drawing a blank on this one too.  The composition is OK, maybe cropped a little too tight on the left side.  The focus is very sharp, but the shadows are a little distracting.', '2005-09-30 11:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750227, 235870, 26255, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but to me it says more "Aaaahhhhh--- That''s the spot" more than "Friendship: Love is in the air"</td>', 'Nice picture, but to me it says more "Aaaahhhhh--- That''s the spot" more than "Friendship: Love is in the air"', '2005-09-30 11:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750230, 235687, 26255, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I love the matching crosses.  Maybe cropping out the left side of the image just in front of the church would help just a little.</td>', 'Great shot.  I love the matching crosses.  Maybe cropping out the left side of the image just in front of the church would help just a little.', '2005-09-30 11:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750234, 236336, 26255, '<td valign="top">Good capture... Maybe just a tad too dark, and you might want to consider cropping out more of the bottom (the exposed roots are a distraction).</td>', 'Good capture... Maybe just a tad too dark, and you might want to consider cropping out more of the bottom (the exposed roots are a distraction).', '2005-09-30 11:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750237, 236074, 26255, '<td valign="top">I like the grain, and the statement.  Would be a perfect shot if not for the border.</td>', 'I like the grain, and the statement.  Would be a perfect shot if not for the border.', '2005-09-30 11:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750239, 236185, 26255, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp image.  I love the colors and the perspective on the two birds!</td>', 'Nice sharp image.  I love the colors and the perspective on the two birds!', '2005-09-30 11:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750240, 236364, 26255, '<td valign="top">Great Shot!  Very emotive! - 9</td>', 'Great Shot!  Very emotive! - 9', '2005-09-30 11:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750241, 236201, 26255, '<td valign="top">Potentially a very cute shot, but the lighting is way too dark.  The background is a distraction also.</td>', 'Potentially a very cute shot, but the lighting is way too dark.  The background is a distraction also.', '2005-09-30 11:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750243, 236382, 26255, '<td valign="top">Cute shot, I even don''t mind the border.  The wrinkled background does detract from the image a little IMHO.</td>', 'Cute shot, I even don''t mind the border.  The wrinkled background does detract from the image a little IMHO.', '2005-09-30 11:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1750247, 235743, 26255, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  It''s a little "low contrast" for my taste, but overall I like the composition.</td>', 'Nice capture.  It''s a little "low contrast" for my taste, but overall I like the composition.', '2005-09-30 11:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
