(1752406, 236284, 15002, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  It''s a bit of a stretch to meet the challenge, but its good enough that I''ll play along.</td>', 'Great capture.  It''s a bit of a stretch to meet the challenge, but its good enough that I''ll play along.', '2005-10-01 14:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
