(1752426, 235412, 15002, '<td valign="top">At this size I can not tell for sure what is out in the water.  I''m guessing a ship.  Moving fowrard would cut out the distraction foreground element the fill more of the frame with the ship.  Putting the horizon lower (1/3) or higher (2/3) would improve the composition.</td>', 'At this size I can not tell for sure what is out in the water.  I''m guessing a ship.  Moving fowrard would cut out the distraction foreground element the fill more of the frame with the ship.  Putting the horizon lower (1/3) or higher (2/3) would improve the composition.', '2005-10-01 14:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752430, 236163, 15002, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge well.  Emotiotive image.  The subjects skin has alot of noise artifacts.  Overall nice job.</td>', 'Meets the challenge well.  Emotiotive image.  The subjects skin has alot of noise artifacts.  Overall nice job.', '2005-10-01 14:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
