(1753852, 235878, 29009, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  I think there is too much negative space in the composition, but that''s just me.  Overall, a decent shot.</td>', 'Good idea.  I think there is too much negative space in the composition, but that''s just me.  Overall, a decent shot.', '2005-10-02 14:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753856, 236254, 29009, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cute.  Good use of DOF, but the colors aren''t doing much for me.  Perhaps in black and white?  Overall, the shot made me smile - thanks!</td>', 'This is pretty cute.  Good use of DOF, but the colors aren''t doing much for me.  Perhaps in black and white?  Overall, the shot made me smile - thanks!', '2005-10-02 14:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753858, 236118, 29009, '<td valign="top">Great colors!  Good job.</td>', 'Great colors!  Good job.', '2005-10-02 14:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753860, 236273, 29009, '<td valign="top">Good facial expression on the dog.  Unfortunately, the screen door looks rather ordinary and the focal point doesn''t take up enough space in the frame.</td>', 'Good facial expression on the dog.  Unfortunately, the screen door looks rather ordinary and the focal point doesn''t take up enough space in the frame.', '2005-10-02 14:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753865, 236198, 29009, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture - really shows the idea of friendship.  You''ve caught the light just right with your point of view - good work!</td>', 'Excellent capture - really shows the idea of friendship.  You''ve caught the light just right with your point of view - good work!', '2005-10-02 14:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753867, 236203, 29009, '<td valign="top">Composition is great - good use of DOF.  This has lots of visual appeal and I could definitely see this as a real greeting card.</td>', 'Composition is great - good use of DOF.  This has lots of visual appeal and I could definitely see this as a real greeting card.', '2005-10-02 14:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753870, 235350, 29009, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  With regard to composition, there appears to be too much negative space on the left and not enough on the top of the frame.  The selective saturation doesn''t add very much visual interest, as increasing attention to the clothing doesn''t reinforce your theme of friendship.  Overall, a good shot.</td>', 'Good idea.  With regard to composition, there appears to be too much negative space on the left and not enough on the top of the frame.  The selective saturation doesn''t add very much visual interest, as increasing attention to the clothing doesn''t reinforce your theme of friendship.  Overall, a good shot.', '2005-10-02 14:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753882, 236211, 29009, '<td valign="top">Great colors.  I don''t see the reference to "Thinking of You" but I didn''t vote down for it.</td>', 'Great colors.  I don''t see the reference to "Thinking of You" but I didn''t vote down for it.', '2005-10-02 15:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753885, 236331, 29009, '<td valign="top">Nice starburst effect on the flame.  The shadow is a bit distracting, and I don''t understand the significance of the stones in the cupcake wrappers.  Why not use a real cupcake?</td>', 'Nice starburst effect on the flame.  The shadow is a bit distracting, and I don''t understand the significance of the stones in the cupcake wrappers.  Why not use a real cupcake?', '2005-10-02 15:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753890, 236122, 29009, '<td valign="top">A very good capture.  Unfortunately, the shoes are a huge distraction for me.  Overall, a good shot.</td>', 'A very good capture.  Unfortunately, the shoes are a huge distraction for me.  Overall, a good shot.', '2005-10-02 15:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
