(1755050, 236346, 41845, '<td valign="top">Congrats Nico!  What a perfect entry for this challenge.</td>', 'Congrats Nico!  What a perfect entry for this challenge.', '2005-10-03 03:24:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(1755051, 234178, 39163, '<td valign="top">My first in the top 20 and my first in the top 10% so I am very happy.  Thanks for all the great comments on the picture - The flower is from my garden, and I took the picture early in the week and was very happy with it.  I tried it without the border but it didn''t work.  Looked to get a gold coloured border, but eventually took the colour from the stamen in the middle of the flower.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-03 02:25:25.</i></td>', 'My first in the top 20 and my first in the top 10% so I am very happy.  Thanks for all the great comments on the picture - The flower is from my garden, and I took the picture early in the week and was very happy with it.  I tried it without the border but it didn''t work.  Looked to get a gold coloured border, but eventually took the colour from the stamen in the middle of the flower.', '2005-10-03 03:24:21.000000', '2005-10-03 03:25:25.000000', 0),
(1755057, 235880, 37673, '<td valign="top">Sorry guy''s it was a bad attempt at humor. The "Get Well'' was meant for the flowers. They looked pretty sad.</td>', 'Sorry guy''s it was a bad attempt at humor. The "Get Well'' was meant for the flowers. They looked pretty sad.', '2005-10-03 03:27:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(1755068, 236381, 28742, '<td valign="top">Well as Joey pointed out, this is almost a rip off of his shot. I almost pulled it after Joey''s comment, but it was not conscious plagiarism - heck, I was passing out in bathrooms before Joey was born! So what the heck. I''ll rename it to "Nice party, Joey!" :)<br/> <br/>And for the record, that''s a <u>month''s worth</u> of ESB. I save the bottles for my neighbor who microbrews.</td>', 'Well as Joey pointed out, this is almost a rip off of his shot. I almost pulled it after Joey''s comment, but it was not conscious plagiarism - heck, I was passing out in bathrooms before Joey was born! So what the heck. I''ll rename it to "Nice party, Joey!" :) And for the record, that''s a month''s worth of ESB. I save the bottles for my neighbor who microbrews.', '2005-10-03 03:40:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(1755071, 236033, 35775, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot, congrats on the blue ribbon.</td>', 'Fantastic shot, congrats on the blue ribbon.', '2005-10-03 03:48:14.000000', NULL, 0),
