(1755209, 236376, 18552, '<td valign="top">Becky, I love this statue of Christ - the lighting in your picture is beautiful. I used to fire small ceramic versions of this statue in my kiln for Seminary Graduation here.</td>', 'Becky, I love this statue of Christ - the lighting in your picture is beautiful. I used to fire small ceramic versions of this statue in my kiln for Seminary Graduation here.', '2005-10-03 06:40:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(1755231, 236225, 30364, '<td valign="top">Greetings to you and Calvin from the Critique Club!<br/>He''s a perky little dude, and you''ve taken a very appealing photograph of him.  Obviously this was your intention, but Calvin''s praying for the recipient''s safe recovery seems to me all the more effective because he actually seems to have an anxious expression on his face!  Now you may say that I''ve just been looking at the photograph for longer than was good for me, and thus I''ve begun to see things, but he definitely does look worried and concerned to me, so there.  Anyway, this image is not high art, and you didn''t intend it to be. So you don''t need any guff from me about composition, or tonal balance, or any of that stuff.  That''s not the point of your shot.  What it is is a very competent and engaging shot of a nice little critter, and also a legitimate and original take on the challenge theme.</td>', 'Greetings to you and Calvin from the Critique Club!He''s a perky little dude, and you''ve taken a very appealing photograph of him.  Obviously this was your intention, but Calvin''s praying for the recipient''s safe recovery seems to me all the more effective because he actually seems to have an anxious expression on his face!  Now you may say that I''ve just been looking at the photograph for longer than was good for me, and thus I''ve begun to see things, but he definitely does look worried and concerned to me, so there.  Anyway, this image is not high art, and you didn''t intend it to be. So you don''t need any guff from me about composition, or tonal balance, or any of that stuff.  That''s not the point of your shot.  What it is is a very competent and engaging shot of a nice little critter, and also a legitimate and original take on the challenge theme.', '2005-10-03 07:20:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(1755232, 236124, 30364, '<td valign="top">Hey, I think you still look pretty good this way!  Wouldn''t trust you with my power tools while I was sleeping, though.</td>', 'Hey, I think you still look pretty good this way!  Wouldn''t trust you with my power tools while I was sleeping, though.', '2005-10-03 07:23:19.000000', NULL, 0),
