(1755266, 236124, 18450, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club :-) <br/> <br/>Personally I think this is a great shot, a very funny take on the challenge and the sort of image I''d buy on a card. Focus and lighting on the face is excellent, good grungy feel to the editing. <br/> <br/>I think in this challenge dpc voters were looking for traditional ''pretty'' shots (:P tongue in cheek since I had one... fluffy ducklings)or images that tugged at the heart strings. Out of the box, creative work like this got voted down. <br/> <br/>Keep up the good work, your portfolio is inspirational.<br/> <br/>sue</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club :-)  Personally I think this is a great shot, a very funny take on the challenge and the sort of image I''d buy on a card. Focus and lighting on the face is excellent, good grungy feel to the editing.  I think in this challenge dpc voters were looking for traditional ''pretty'' shots (:P tongue in cheek since I had one... fluffy ducklings)or images that tugged at the heart strings. Out of the box, creative work like this got voted down.  Keep up the good work, your portfolio is inspirational. sue', '2005-10-03 08:35:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(1755267, 236260, 14620, '<td valign="top">Beauty Sher! ;-)</td>', 'Beauty Sher! ;-)', '2005-10-03 08:35:30.000000', NULL, 0),
