(1769606, 236339, 23394, '<td valign="top">simply beautiful!  i hope this inspires others to go out and realize for themselves just how damn hard it is to get a shot like this!  it takes skill, a good eye, patience, and plenty of time, because shots like this are just not automatic!  great work!</td>', 'simply beautiful!  i hope this inspires others to go out and realize for themselves just how damn hard it is to get a shot like this!  it takes skill, a good eye, patience, and plenty of time, because shots like this are just not automatic!  great work!', '2005-10-08 09:15:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(1769622, 236002, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is a great idea for a shot.  i think you probably could have seen a half to a full point improvement if you''d had a bit more light so that there would be more contrast between the subject and the background, and if you''d had opened up to about 5.6.  that lens is so perfect for portraits, where you want a short dof, but for something like this, you''d want everything to be ''dpc-sharp''.  keep it up!</td>', 'this is a great idea for a shot.  i think you probably could have seen a half to a full point improvement if you''d had a bit more light so that there would be more contrast between the subject and the background, and if you''d had opened up to about 5.6.  that lens is so perfect for portraits, where you want a short dof, but for something like this, you''d want everything to be ''dpc-sharp''.  keep it up!', '2005-10-08 09:32:01.000000', NULL, 0),
